        "title": "Add Mattermost provider server",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add a Mattermost REST and WebSocket provider server for native OpenClaw text DM/channel roundtrips\n- add the OpenClaw bridge, CLI registration, exports, manifests, recorder mapping, and setup docs\n- authenticate Mattermost REST/WebSocket clients, deliver admin inbound as native `posted` events, and record outbound posts\n\n## Scope\n\n- supports the OpenClaw paths needed for identity, user/channel lookup, direct-channel creation, typing, post create/update/delete, and WebSocket inbound\n- disables Mattermost mention gating and streaming in the generated QA binding so deterministic text roundtrips produce one final recorder event\n- thread-shaped inbound/recorder events are preserved, but agent delivery rejects thread targets until the OpenClaw QA wiring step forwards a thread ID separately\n- no OpenClaw channel transport change is required because Mattermost already accepts `baseUrl` and `botToken`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm verify` (36 files, 171 tests)\n- OpenClaw's real Mattermost client and WebSocket monitor helper passed against the local server\n- autoreview: clean, no actionable findings\n",
